Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你开的太过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的驾驶技术怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 前面有陨石群
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要撞到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:08.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 还以为你要不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得不错嘛 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 一口气冲过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这样下去会完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快180度旋转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A梦 控制杆不听使唤...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 GAME OVER了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香也被打败了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样 我跟小夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去终点了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在背后搞偷袭 太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样也好 赢了就行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个游戏有点太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就说过很难的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底 都是因为你经常跟小夫争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 他那么的自满
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是爸爸买给我的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不去一两次宇宙旅行 会被人笑老套的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从大宇宙看上去 地球就跟豆子一样小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 从宇宙那里看地球 非常的美丽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以拜托爸爸准备你们的份哦 怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.67,0:03:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(71.339,470)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有大雄的份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有言在先 去的话要接受训练的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又迟钝又没运动神经的没用鬼大雄 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 没我这么有体力跟勇敢的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 什么时候出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天吗 后天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能这么快就能去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要等到21世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 我马上就去拜托哆啦A梦带我去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拜托爸爸准备大雄的份吧 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才拿出这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到一会儿就完蛋了 真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 很快就到终点了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我不会输给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 操控失灵 怎么回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小 小夫 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输了应该会被退出外面的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难 难道我们被困在游戏里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 是有生命的树
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多天然的泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于找到了 我们居住的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去调查一下这个星球的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『室内宇宙飞船』
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以在室内体验宇宙船内的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有趣的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设置到地球跟月亮之间的距离 好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没重力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会习惯的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经习惯了 好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都分不清上下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有重力 所以没有上下的分别
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 出去外面看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这房间里面相当于宇宙船 打开窗户的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟空气一起被吸去外面的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样子啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我们喝剩的汽水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像肥皂泡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要这样子啦 会沾到衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里放屁的话 会像火箭一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你们静点玩好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 吃西瓜...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈的声音...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里全成了宇宙船的状态了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 谁帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得赶快停止才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是搞这些恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便整理好不要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 漫画、模型空盒子满地都是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像大扫除似的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 胖虎他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 还在游戏里面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那个『星球撞击游戏』在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道去了哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 知不知道画着宇宙图画的 这么大的盒子在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个模型盒子吗 跟垃圾一起扔掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 你们收拾好房间了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找清楚看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确扔在那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去找一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两人明明还没收拾好房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏结束后应该会出来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们果然还没回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪 应该早就到终点 或是game over了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是游戏出了故障 被困在游戏里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那游戏在垃圾站不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到可能太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:12:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『历史照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候照相有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个照相机可以追溯之前的时间摄像的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如设置到四小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄放屁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是窗破了 游戏吹到了外面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 妈妈收拾东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈啊 拿着那游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去垃圾站
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以照到拿走游戏的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏还在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的光搬走了游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞向这个方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那边的拐角了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里拐弯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了学校的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是后山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是去了后山
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了山脚的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是在这附近消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被UFO掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我破坏自己赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们快去追吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『竹蜻蜓』不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不知道那是哪个星球的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点拿火箭出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的倒简单
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙是很广阔的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银河系里像地球一样星球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这大宇宙里就有一亿万倍那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个找的话 一生也找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是石头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像星星的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是地球的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大发现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是UFO的驾驶员丢失的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个的话就有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙救命艇』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设定好这块石头的探索装置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能在宇宙中追寻这块石头的来历
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 马上出发
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是宇宙是非常危险的地方 没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这当然知道 但是不能放着他们不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 马上出发
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快要达到瞬间跳跃极限 快要达到瞬间跳跃极限
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃结束 瞬间跳跃结束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离子风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得 得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.53,0:18:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不是大雄的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是哪儿的工厂仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像从外面上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 纹丝不动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像科幻电影一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在游戏里面...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都还在瞬间跳跃的空间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了漫无边际的遥远宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像从瞬间跳跃里出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说接近那块石头的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发 发生什么事了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是进入离子风暴里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片上看到过的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说胖虎跟小夫就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎被击中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去用『时光布』修理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙霜-喷雾型』
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷上这个 就等于有穿上宇宙服的状态了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气排出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算打开门也不用担心会被吸出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可真惨...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光布』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光布』...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舍弃『救命艇』  快脱出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去UFO那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是在玩『室内宇宙飞船』那样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 这里是真正的宇宙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种地方 亏你还能放出屁来...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进去里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好像是仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会有人在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 因为不知道是什么样的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这声音是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(180.33,470)\fs24}我知心的朋友 太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(675.743,470)\fs24}太好了 你们都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 这里到底是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.49,0:22:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 被UFO掠走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么这里是真正的宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 竟然会弄错路线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃之后就是这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:23:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 不走出这里的话就无法航行了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辅助回路 最大出力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启航
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源开到最大了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.87,0:23:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像冲出离子风暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.62,0:23:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多破烂儿 要运到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 首先试着交涉看看能不能让我们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 这个UFO的宇宙人是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.81,0:24:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会发光  还很小的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是萤火星人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定 真面目是这样的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 不要这样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.10,0:24:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是狐狸星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么都好 应该能好好跟他们商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.64,0:24:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.39,0:24:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会真的是 很可怕的外星人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.03,0:24:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你打了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.83,0:24:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.24,0:24:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我们是 说来话长...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.74,0:24:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是宇宙少年骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来我们的宇宙船里 想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:57.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 是你们擅自带我们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才没有带人上来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们随便上来 我要逮捕你们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.51,0:25:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会让你们得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是别反抗比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.61,0:25:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门 放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.17,0:25:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就狠狠揍你们一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.93,0:25:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好谈的话 我想他们应该会理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.55,0:25:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被没收了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.83,0:25:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些野蛮人到底是哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快回去寻找归路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:26:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 不好了 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.85,0:26:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.33,0:26:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是刚才的离子风暴的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.41,0:26:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测量一下附近可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鹤见星系 S56
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个未知的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.47,0:26:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那里修理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.45,0:26:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.95,0:26:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球真美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.81,0:26:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多绿色植物就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 调查一下大气状况
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.85,0:26:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.45,0:27:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氯气占95％ 一滴水也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.57,0:27:02.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多土块
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.99,0:27:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某个星球着陆了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪儿的星球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好 把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.88,0:27:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好 把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.97,0:27:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你有带来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都完全忘了有这样的法宝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.19,0:27:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 大家想回哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.52,0:27:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的 我的家里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去空地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.64,0:27:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.92,0:27:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得来到真正的宇宙 不冒一下险就回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.47,0:28:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒险已经足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.38,0:28:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大雄说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.90,0:28:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就结束的话太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.35,0:28:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 看看这个星球再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.89,0:28:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不想再让大家犯险了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个万一的话马上用『随意门』回去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.29,0:28:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 修理状况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.21,0:28:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 完全损坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置用不了的话 回去太耗时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要花点时间才能修理好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.13,0:28:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这次的调查太多问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.54,0:28:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚出发通信机就坏了 无法传送资料
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又被奇怪的入侵者闯进
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.59,0:29:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船还故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是因为我丢了神树之果
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果丢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.87,0:29:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么重要的东西到底在哪儿丢失的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.07,0:29:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大概在MS3那个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.18,0:29:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.64,0:29:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 那个星球真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要岔开话题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.59,0:29:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植物跟泥土都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就叫自然美
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.97,0:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到这个 心情就不由变得平静
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安看到植物就会变得两眼放光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.20,0:29:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是植物叶子的细胞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.26,0:29:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 动了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有生命的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 跟我们的人造树木完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:30:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈一直说 想生活在自然的花草树木的星球居住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 我们一定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吃空间虫』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.00,0:30:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃掉超空间 制造出逃生通道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.26,0:30:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青虫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起见 给你们都喷上『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.42,0:30:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫虫 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.73,0:30:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做好觉悟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.73,0:30:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 开始宇宙探险了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.75,0:30:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的事啊 我要是能办到该多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.11,0:30:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的梦 这样的梦 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO在那里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.80,0:30:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然时间不长 谢谢你们照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.45,0:30:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在这颗星球探险了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:31:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.26,0:31:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空好辽阔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.95,0:31:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.78,0:31:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪兽什么的 出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的出现的话该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候 就拜托哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.38,0:31:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.27,0:31:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先回去UFO里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.43,0:31:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超空间被扭曲了 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.31,0:31:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金属身体的蛛蛛...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.45,0:31:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.42,0:31:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.71,0:31:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快拿武器出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.53,0:31:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带着的武器都对付不了它的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.91,0:32:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 『随意门』...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.99,0:32:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 在哪...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.75,0:32:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.46,0:32:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去大雄的房间  快快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.51,0:32:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.10,0:32:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.09,0:32:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.69,0:32:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.41,0:32:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.99,0:32:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.07,0:32:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能喷出金属蜘蛛丝 还有能溶解金属的毒液
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么『随意门』用不了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.65,0:33:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕我们到了 连『随意门』都去不到的遥远地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.41,0:33:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然要靠他们用UFO载我们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.80,0:33:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 金属蜘蛛会袭击UFO的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.77,0:33:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.35,0:33:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 这样下去的话UFO会被溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.17,0:33:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快做点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 有个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.41,0:33:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吹走的喇叭』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.75,0:33:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要一吹这个喇叭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.14,0:33:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都会跟随着喇叭声出发再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.86,0:33:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事后再说明好了 快快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.72,0:33:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:33:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没什么变化
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是声音太小 听不到？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.16,0:34:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 给我『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.94,0:34:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.51,0:34:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.83,0:34:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 绝对能听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.87,0:34:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.73,0:34:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 靠近点吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 看天上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 那些人什么时候出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且没穿宇宙服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.78,0:34:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不能掉以轻心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.74,0:34:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.38,0:34:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看 它们逃到山上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 它们不会再回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.59,0:35:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好宏亮的声音 不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们赶走的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.72,0:35:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物质转换机』
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个将蜘蛛丝换成毛线
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.59,0:35:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛线？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.54,0:35:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.08,0:35:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.25,0:35:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成毛线了 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以做围巾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.08,0:35:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看来不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.03,0:36:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我觉得有点不安
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 只是这么觉得而已
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位救了我们 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新邀请你们上来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.94,0:36:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 这样就有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.67,0:36:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说他们在这里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.79,0:36:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 都是因为随便捡破烂儿才会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是破烂儿 也是很好的调查材料
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是什么破烂儿不破烂儿 这是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.79,0:36:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这个 快送我们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.19,0:36:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们不明不白的被你们带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.07,0:36:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可伤脑筋 因为瞬间跳跃航行装置故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.83,0:36:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用那个的话不能回地球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.56,0:36:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是说不能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:37:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概要一亿八百万年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.69,0:37:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一亿年.....
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.25,0:37:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.71,0:37:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是『时光布』跟『救命艇』都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.82,0:37:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.76,0:37:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.71,0:37:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个回去的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是带他们去银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.02,0:37:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银河漂流船队？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我们要回去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.45,0:37:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不像你们那样有个安居的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.94,0:37:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 把记录放映出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.74,0:37:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我们的祖先舍弃了星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舍弃星球？  为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不能再居住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.23,0:37:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为物质文明过于发达 环境不断被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 大气被破坏 植物枯竭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.15,0:37:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来变成一个出门都要带上呼吸装置的死亡之星
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.79,0:38:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年以来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.50,0:38:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找寻一个绿色的理想星球
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.26,0:38:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直在无边的宇宙漂流
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.49,0:38:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期间会遇到同样失去星球的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.64,0:38:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起组成银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在宇宙船上出生的新一代
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.98,0:39:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了找寻可以让我们居住的母星 而组成了调查团
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.79,0:39:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是宇宙少年骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.91,0:39:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.73,0:39:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们四人在太阳系上找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了一个非常美丽的MS3－叫做地球的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.09,0:39:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说找到... 可地球是我们的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.35,0:39:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会让给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.84,0:39:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 我们没打算侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.25,0:39:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是希望通过谈判 达到和平移居地球的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.06,0:39:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自古流传下来的教导
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来先回船队修理好船 就马上送你们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.95,0:39:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.71,0:39:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.46,0:39:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.53,0:39:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,资料机器人 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.07,0:39:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.42,0:39:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫李安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.72,0:39:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,源静香
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.50,0:39:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫菲莉亚 多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.24,0:39:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.77,0:39:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.34,0:39:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么 放我下来 放我下来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.11,0:39:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎是这样对人表示友好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发要花些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.07,0:40:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉就让你们这里稍事休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.79,0:40:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.11,0:40:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好我们也很累了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.36,0:40:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 地球上出发时已经是夜里了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.14,0:40:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 我想这里没有可以洗澡的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 没有热水出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.89,0:40:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 因为除了我就没什么人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.95,0:40:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微要用点技巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.87,0:40:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.71,0:40:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面可以呼吸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.46,0:40:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.59,0:40:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.42,0:41:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都叫李安每天洗的 他就是不听
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.85,0:41:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟李安真的很要好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.28,0:41:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是朋友而已
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.45,0:41:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.88,0:41:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能让李安得到幸福的话 我什么都会做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.14,0:41:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 MS3-地球的资料传来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.61,0:41:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让只老鼠混进那里果然没白费
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.49,0:42:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球果然是个理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.86,0:42:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是踏破铁鞋无觅处
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.86,0:42:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 在这之前还有一些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.16,0:42:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.81,0:42:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 工程还差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.44,0:42:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差些许而已
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.40,0:42:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何 结果一定能让你满意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.01,0:42:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待着 摩亚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.81,0:42:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我忠实的仆人们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.01,0:42:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了得到我们的星球 要尽快完成
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.11,0:43:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说要帮忙修理 可是我还很困啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人也会困的吗 真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.46,0:43:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把那片电路板更换一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.80,0:43:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果『时光布』在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的机器人拥有的道具真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.40,0:43:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是从未来来的机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.00,0:43:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说 现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.42,0:43:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 住手 现在是重要的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.04,0:43:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吃我 我不好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.96,0:43:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『万能缰绳』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.02,0:43:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.03,0:43:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.30,0:43:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦要被吃掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.83,0:43:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.46,0:43:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.47,0:43:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很温驯 大家也来坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.08,0:44:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 不要吓人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.19,0:44:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.06,0:44:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安也来坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 坐上去舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.49,0:44:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们拥有的力量真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.61,0:44:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是托哆啦A梦的福
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.41,0:44:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真神奇 有些什么机关的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.66,0:44:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手被缠住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.84,0:44:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.43,0:44:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.96,0:44:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.71,0:44:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬崖...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危险
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.39,0:45:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我 大雄真勇敢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.09,0:45:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人这么说还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.69,0:45:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.71,0:45:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.68,0:45:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.39,0:45:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.47,0:45:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.70,0:45:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发准备OK
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.31,0:45:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.11,0:45:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好 毛线还没清理
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.09,0:45:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 这不影响出发
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.24,0:45:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于可以去船队了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.31,0:46:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 因为没有用瞬间跳跃航行装置
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.98,0:46:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中得找个星球停下来 让引擎休息
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.29,0:46:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去船队要花些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.62,0:46:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 还要这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.63,0:46:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这总比要花一亿年要好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.74,0:46:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.23,0:46:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到星球的话再通知你们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.07,0:46:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之前先休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.36,0:46:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多星球 却不能让生物居住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.77,0:46:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船队的人都已经找了三百年
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.51,0:46:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是让自己的星球变得不堪的祖先的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.45,0:46:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.24,0:46:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能 这里可是UFO里面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:46:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.31,0:46:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.04,0:47:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是引擎故障的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.84,0:47:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.53,0:47:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 偏离轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.13,0:47:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被什么拉住了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.95,0:47:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 快去调查原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.15,0:47:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.29,0:47:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.36,0:47:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一光年前面 有个黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.11,0:47:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 引擎开到最大
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.56,0:47:43.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到正常航道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.66,0:47:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.83,0:47:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.36,0:47:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才真危险 如果再近一点的话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被吸进去 再也出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.67,0:48:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.17,0:48:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽快 找寻可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.17,0:48:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为引擎有些负荷过重了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.03,0:48:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真想看看那个黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 真到了能看到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被吸进去 再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.87,0:48:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围的星球也好 什么东西都会被吸进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.48,0:48:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.08,0:48:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我肚子饿得像黑洞一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.52,0:48:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.11,0:48:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没找到可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 航道有点偏离 不过找到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.06,0:48:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑能源状况 还是快点着陆比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.65,0:48:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那里着陆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.27,0:49:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真大的雾啊 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 雷达...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.21,0:49:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.32,0:49:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.54,0:49:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.77,0:49:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某个星球着陆了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.64,0:49:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板开着
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.68,0:49:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安他们先下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.21,0:49:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也出去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.58,0:50:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的雾
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.14,0:50:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个气味是？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.68,0:50:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟后山的树一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.22,0:50:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.72,0:50:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是雾散了是地球的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这种玩笑不要开啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.52,0:50:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雾散了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.16,0:50:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.93,0:50:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.73,0:50:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是后山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.18,0:50:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.87,0:50:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.90,0:50:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.50,0:50:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.51,0:50:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我玩的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.78,0:50:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.68,0:50:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安他们应该早和我们说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.42,0:50:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是想给我们惊喜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.12,0:50:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.23,0:50:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是之前的测验卷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.76,0:50:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验卷？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.02,0:50:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1...100分？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.05,0:50:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是给你的奖励 努力学习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.14,0:51:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 谢谢老师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.90,0:51:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.61,0:51:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用『梦境确定机』吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.17,0:51:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点给妈妈看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.57,0:51:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.37,0:51:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好几天没回去 妈妈一定会大发雷霆的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.39,0:51:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.73,0:51:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.43,0:51:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.48,0:51:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.99,0:51:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.90,0:51:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 给你的铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.91,0:51:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.72,0:51:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.96,0:51:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.14,0:51:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 完全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.37,0:51:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开地球之前捡到的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.12,0:51:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.28,0:51:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.37,0:51:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆 哆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.46,0:51:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.50,0:51:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.96,0:51:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多吃一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.50,0:51:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.53,0:52:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.68,0:52:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.18,0:52:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这里不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.94,0:52:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 这不是平时玩耍的空地吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.07,0:52:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我清醒过来 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.75,0:52:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被幻觉迷惑了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.20,0:52:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.71,0:52:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.33,0:52:28.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快唤醒大家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.97,0:52:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我找 我找
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.97,0:52:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『唤醒远处的人闹钟』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.21,0:52:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我晕过去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.52,0:52:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.41,0:52:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄他们 洛古 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.93,0:53:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板关上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.20,0:53:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 快把甲板打开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.19,0:53:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.82,0:53:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开 快开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.81,0:53:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 为什么开不了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.74,0:53:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 好像故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.41,0:53:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.29,0:53:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快开 快打开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.20,0:53:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 给我开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.60,0:53:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.63,0:53:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.86,0:53:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.10,0:53:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.03,0:53:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.81,0:53:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.88,0:53:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.11,0:53:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进去里面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.17,0:53:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.13,0:53:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.22,0:54:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻觉之星？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.18,0:54:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太想回地球了 所以才会被骗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.27,0:54:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是幻觉...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻觉也好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.49,0:54:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经受不了一直在宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.84,0:54:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.74,0:54:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 好想在妈妈还活着的时候 找到合适的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.97,0:54:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在 为了银河漂流船队的所有人 我要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.61,0:54:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到船队的轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.02,0:54:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 菲莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.28,0:54:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在隔壁的雷达室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.16,0:54:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.96,0:54:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.78,0:55:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.69,0:55:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚是你救了我的吧 我是来跟你道谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.31,0:55:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.08,0:55:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.37,0:55:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.34,0:55:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就能回去的 不用花一亿年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.06,0:55:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.61,0:55:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.50,0:55:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.77,0:55:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.20,0:55:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有事情发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.10,0:55:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.35,0:55:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船偏离了航路
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.69,0:55:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是操作错误了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.60,0:55:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.19,0:55:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.94,0:55:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.63,0:55:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.85,0:55:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像宇宙船的坟场
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.75,0:55:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太凄惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.74,0:56:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源急速下降 这是矿石生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.23,0:56:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们在吃飞船的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.83,0:56:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快被挤坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.45,0:56:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 周围的宇宙船就是被它们弄报废的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.61,0:56:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎停止
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.61,0:56:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源开始见底了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.50,0:56:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.50,0:56:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是找到了新的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.43,0:56:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.65,0:56:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是飞弹
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.93,0:56:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.34,0:56:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.49,0:56:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在快逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 没能源了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.76,0:57:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飞弹是哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.87,0:57:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我们带你们离开
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.98,0:57:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飞船是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.25,0:57:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要带我们去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.81,0:57:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安份点跟来就是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.51,0:57:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的飞船都没生命反应
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.07,0:57:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么人在操纵着那些飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.80,0:57:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去船队的话 就回不了地球对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.05,0:57:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.19,0:57:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只能静观其变
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.46,0:57:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个惑星是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.26,0:57:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 这里到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.33,0:58:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很宏伟的要塞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回来了 李安
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.48,0:58:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是被选中的骑士们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.93,0:58:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于找到了个理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.43,0:58:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.29,0:58:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你在这里 这里是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.74,0:58:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是独立军的前线基地
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.06,0:58:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独立军？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.80,0:58:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了银河漂流船队的市民们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要得到可以居住的母星 而组成的崇高部队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是何时成立的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.87,0:58:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们出去调查之后 司令官成立的独立军
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.39,0:58:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了教导吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.68,0:59:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不论什么情况 都不能采用任何侵略手段
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说教导 不要笑话了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.19,0:59:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年不断的彷徨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.96,0:59:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是已经终于找到了理想星球－地球了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.01,0:59:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.12,0:59:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是潜入你们里面的老鼠报告的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.53,0:59:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 哪儿 在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.46,0:59:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠是指间谍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.09,0:59:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.10,0:59:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是真的吧 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.31,0:59:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 通信器不是坏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.62,0:59:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 是我弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.81,0:59:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.38,0:59:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不想让你知道独立军的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.36,0:59:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我知道你是不会协助的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.03,0:59:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.81,0:59:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道甲板打不开的时候也是你...？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.14,0:59:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.35,0:59:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.45,0:59:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们拥有神奇的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.55,1:00:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了李安不被地球人所妨碍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.98,1:00:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.25,1:00:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你救了我...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.09,1:00:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诱导我们去宇宙船的墓场 把我们带来这里也是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.31,1:00:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 这样才更...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.10,1:00:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.21,1:00:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全是为了你...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.15,1:00:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.81,1:00:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.57,1:00:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.10,1:00:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球 是地球人的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.45,1:00:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.69,1:00:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还那么说吗 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.03,1:00:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带这些人去监牢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.10,1:00:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.06,1:00:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.39,1:00:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.33,1:00:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 过来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.09,1:00:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.83,1:01:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫他爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.14,1:01:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个司令官是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.55,1:01:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官是李安的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.59,1:01:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.48,1:01:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是李安的错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.53,1:01:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从那个叫摩亚的人来了之后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.80,1:01:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸跟大家都变了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.38,1:01:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.66,1:01:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官旁边的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.35,1:01:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.43,1:01:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.63,1:01:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs23}诺查丹玛斯：法国医师、占星术师
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.63,1:01:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺查丹玛斯的预言里提到 毁灭地球的大魔王的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.87,1:01:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 哆啦A梦是从22世纪来的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.42,1:01:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 未来是有可能改变的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.38,1:01:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管如何 这样下去的话地球很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.63,1:01:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得从这里逃脱 回去船队
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.77,1:01:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.54,1:01:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『潜地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.02,1:01:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是潜水艇吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.81,1:02:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以潜入地下 是『潜地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.46,1:02:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现就糟糕了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.39,1:02:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.60,1:02:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 飞船的能源能不能到达母船
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.46,1:02:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能 如果是逃到母船附近的轨道的话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.14,1:02:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用应急燃料可以去到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.38,1:02:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.31,1:02:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.78,1:02:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.20,1:02:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.43,1:03:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.60,1:03:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 一起走吧 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.93,1:03:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.78,1:03:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.75,1:03:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古的操控真好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.37,1:03:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 都比不上李安啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.01,1:03:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.49,1:03:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介绍一个新同伴给大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新同伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.72,1:03:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.43,1:03:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.70,1:04:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我就知道你一定是站在我们这边的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.27,1:04:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎新同伴吧 好吗 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.70,1:04:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 菲莉亚 拜托你联络船队
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.51,1:04:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.42,1:04:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 轨道怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.76,1:04:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.93,1:04:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 逃脱了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.99,1:04:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都吩咐这么多次看好他们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.57,1:04:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.99,1:04:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 他们用了神奇的道具才...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.52,1:04:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 让地球人去了船队便麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.23,1:04:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快去抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.41,1:04:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.09,1:04:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.28,1:04:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚这贱人 居然背叛我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.71,1:05:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 后面有些什么在追着
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.76,1:05:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无人舰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 开大能源逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.69,1:05:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 燃料用尽了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.00,1:05:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 还没联络上船队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.45,1:05:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该在附近了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.64,1:05:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是独立军捕获船
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.96,1:05:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么辛苦才逃出来的说...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.54,1:05:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要被抓回去吗...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.54,1:05:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.21,1:05:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这道光是？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.87,1:05:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.22,1:05:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.97,1:05:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是船队救了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.95,1:05:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.93,1:05:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是母船啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.43,1:05:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.52,1:05:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.58,1:07:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MSK少年骑士团 辛苦你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.26,1:07:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请马上去协议会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.01,1:07:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎MS3地球人 我们欢迎你们的到来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像知道我们的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.27,1:07:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉了他们大体的情况了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.75,1:07:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们跟我一起 去协议会报告一直以来的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.57,1:07:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 这都是为了地球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.02,1:07:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕摩亚的战略是 打算侵略地球之前 用武力支配母船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.54,1:07:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸竟然会发动战争 简直难以相信
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.63,1:07:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.73,1:07:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.15,1:07:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好强大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.61,1:07:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙船里面居然有这样的大都市
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.35,1:07:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少人口
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.80,1:07:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约一千万人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.21,1:07:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是拉古娜星人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.06,1:08:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年间 像吾郎这样 从其他星球来的住民也很多
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.90,1:08:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是协议会的联邦大厦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.78,1:08:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.55,1:08:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位就是勇敢的地球少年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.33,1:08:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是协议会议长摩滋拉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.45,1:08:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 马上开始汇报吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.40,1:08:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.34,1:08:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的诸位也拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.96,1:08:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.88,1:08:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独立军打算用武力支配船队
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.26,1:08:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还打算侵略他们的星球－地球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.35,1:08:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官怎么会做这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.14,1:08:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从摩亚来了之后 他就变得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.91,1:08:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有逃跑了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.50,1:08:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要舍弃船队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候得战斗才行了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.62,1:08:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我们不懂如何战斗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.47,1:08:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 现在不是说这话的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.97,1:09:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年历史以来 我们还没打过一场仗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕 将来也不会打破这个教导的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.10,1:09:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 我们已经没时间考虑了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.59,1:09:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.38,1:09:17.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去圣域请求神的教导吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.58,1:09:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的神是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.89,1:09:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说去圣域来着
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.96,1:09:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣域是这艘船里 唯一有自然生态的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.59,1:09:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神就在那里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.02,1:09:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的指导者 也是我们的生命之源
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.82,1:09:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底他是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.18,1:09:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非是人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.48,1:09:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的神 尤古道之树
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.51,1:10:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我们的祖先离开惑星拉古娜的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.42,1:10:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个少年 在瓦砾之间的一块土地上 发现一颗发光的树苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.52,1:10:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很小心地带回船上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.47,1:10:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后 大家很小心地照料这颗树苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.65,1:10:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此以来 我们从尤古道之树上学会很多知识
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.19,1:10:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她作为我们的神 存在于我们的心中
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.43,1:10:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲伤 辛苦 迷惘的时候 就会抚摸这个果实听从教导
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.01,1:10:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个形状...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.34,1:10:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟这个一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.66,1:10:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果 这个在哪儿捡到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.04,1:10:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从地球出发的时候丢的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.32,1:10:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这颗树的果实啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.62,1:11:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗果实 是尤古道之树给少年骑士团的信物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.72,1:11:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使离开船队 也会保护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.49,1:11:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是护身符一样的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.27,1:11:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 在幻觉之星让我清醒过来的 是这个护身符啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.87,1:11:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 还给你 不要再丢失了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.60,1:11:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 李安 请求尤古道之树的教导吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.87,1:11:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.16,1:11:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.69,1:11:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.04,1:11:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇迹 已经过世的李安的妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.32,1:11:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安的妈妈已经死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.54,1:11:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在李安还小的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.26,1:11:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸他...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.43,1:11:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.01,1:12:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.39,1:12:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做的事只有一样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.01,1:12:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打倒摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.56,1:12:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亚？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.07,1:12:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把控制爸爸的摩亚打倒
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚用超能力控制人心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.02,1:12:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他操纵了船队的几个人 成立了独立军
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.53,1:12:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亚 独立军就会瓦解
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.20,1:12:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会变回和平
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.06,1:12:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有这种力量的摩亚 我们能对付得了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.23,1:12:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 看看周围
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.09,1:12:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有爱你 信任你...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.46,1:12:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...能够依靠的 新的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.08,1:12:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟神树之果一起 永远守护着你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.49,1:12:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 不要迷惘 勇敢前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.08,1:12:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.80,1:12:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要迷惘 勇敢前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.77,1:13:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.54,1:13:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人和盖亚号的人合流了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得赶快让司令官下决定
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.02,1:13:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 你在犹豫什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.36,1:13:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴多列布军团出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.77,1:13:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向盖亚号发动总攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.95,1:13:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大量独立军的战斗机 正在向这边赶来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.79,1:13:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.34,1:13:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.13,1:13:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.65,1:13:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去打倒摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.38,1:13:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.20,1:13:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我一定会将和平带回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.04,1:13:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,435)\fs24}宇宙少年骑士团全体出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.06,1:14:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,435)\fs24}重复 宇宙少年骑士团全体出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.56,1:14:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 加油
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.72,1:14:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.41,1:14:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.55,1:14:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 燃料怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.42,1:14:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常充足
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.47,1:14:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也出击吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.65,1:14:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 一定要保护好地球
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.21,1:14:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.64,1:14:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.70,1:14:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用游戏里面的宇宙船战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.19,1:14:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.34,1:14:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.56,1:14:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.22,1:14:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要保护好李安哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.33,1:14:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.74,1:14:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开游戏 出去外面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.42,1:15:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.46,1:15:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 这不是游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.58,1:15:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.13,1:15:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了保护地球
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.84,1:15:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.16,1:15:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.11,1:15:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达损坏 撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.79,1:15:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.19,1:15:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被击中了 紧急脱出
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.49,1:15:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要输给大雄了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.48,1:15:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被击中了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.86,1:16:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会输的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.77,1:16:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 不如将基地的控制塔破坏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.12,1:16:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 大雄 帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.98,1:16:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.05,1:16:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前居然没想到...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.21,1:16:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 小夫 胖虎 麻烦你们援助射击
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.99,1:16:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 交给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.66,1:16:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.36,1:16:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然喷了『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.60,1:16:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过因为重力很小 要小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.36,1:16:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.16,1:17:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近处看真大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.47,1:17:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很难破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 用这个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.21,1:17:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『黏土粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.45,1:17:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒上这个 不管什么东西 都会变得像粘土那样软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.58,1:17:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.44,1:17:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 搓圆吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.64,1:17:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样控制塔就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.46,1:17:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 敌人的飞船都不动了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.64,1:17:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.08,1:17:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.93,1:17:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 控制杆被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.94,1:17:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修复不能 攻击艇全灭
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.90,1:17:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是那帮地球人搞得鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.41,1:17:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 我们只有潜入盖亚号
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.93,1:17:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,占领控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.64,1:17:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.10,1:17:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.55,1:17:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不像
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.19,1:18:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.31,1:18:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.52,1:18:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还还还 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.15,1:18:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.88,1:18:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.66,1:18:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.33,1:18:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 摩亚打算将这个要塞开进盖亚号
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.80,1:18:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 他就在这里咯？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.85,1:18:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.95,1:18:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.34,1:18:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.13,1:18:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.34,1:18:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.05,1:18:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快进去里面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.57,1:19:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令室好像是在这边
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.43,1:19:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.49,1:19:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也进去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.03,1:19:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 洛古 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.47,1:19:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本无法接近啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.35,1:19:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 你们根本不是对手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.94,1:19:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离接触还有1分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.73,1:19:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.01,1:19:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用盖亚号的权限控制全市
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.54,1:19:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支配那些市民的时候到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.50,1:19:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会得逞的 摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.82,1:19:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.97,1:19:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.15,1:19:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你是被摩亚的超能力控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.32,1:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 300年来 盖亚号的市民
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.80,1:19:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么希望找到母星-地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在跟市民一起 拿起武器战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.15,1:19:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.41,1:19:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 过来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.30,1:20:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.32,1:20:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷 UFO接近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.34,1:20:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在往控制室方向航行中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.30,1:20:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推测30秒前
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.94,1:20:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 连你也...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.66,1:20:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.14,1:20:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 快杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.34,1:20:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.90,1:20:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.20,1:20:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.67,1:20:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始与盖亚号衔接
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.19,1:20:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衔接完成
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.49,1:20:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 快开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.10,1:20:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 你这个混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.20,1:21:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚 觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.06,1:21:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.81,1:21:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.84,1:21:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.44,1:21:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.74,1:21:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚的超能力 敌不过李安爸爸心中的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.82,1:21:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 真对不起 请原谅爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.29,1:21:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.64,1:21:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.92,1:21:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.78,1:21:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官 我们到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.12,1:21:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都被它控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.31,1:21:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.95,1:21:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.84,1:21:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.53,1:21:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友们 都还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.28,1:22:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.49,1:22:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被李安打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.33,1:22:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.19,1:22:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.59,1:22:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球得救了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.86,1:22:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.58,1:22:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.79,1:22:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.31,1:22:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 李安
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.02,1:22:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听李安说了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.07,1:22:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦酱 真的很感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.94,1:22:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦酱...  我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.93,1:22:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么也没做 是李安的勇气获得了胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.52,1:22:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李安 摩亚到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.38,1:22:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.90,1:22:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机 机器人来的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,构造很简单的机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.38,1:22:35.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像蜕下来的空壳一样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.14,1:22:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙居然拥有超能力 太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.18,1:22:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.18,1:22:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盖亚号的轨道 向要塞的惑星前进了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.31,1:22:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法控制
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.90,1:22:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是衔接的时候出现了故障
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.78,1:22:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧与盖亚号联系
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.59,1:22:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去会跟惑星相撞的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.93,1:22:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.68,1:23:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你这么说...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.47,1:23:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法躲开吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.62,1:23:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.62,1:23:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.30,1:23:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它对"相对静止"的行星起不了作用
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.49,1:23:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是对"相对运动"着的盖亚号用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.63,1:23:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.95,1:23:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.03,1:23:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『放大灯』放大
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.33,1:23:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.44,1:23:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支『放大灯』 威力不够
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.90,1:23:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『复制镜』大量复制
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.86,1:23:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 真聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.58,1:23:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 按照计划
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.78,1:23:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.35,1:23:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.71,1:23:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说明了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.06,1:23:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.20,1:23:59.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全束手无策
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.58,1:24:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 拿好『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.10,1:24:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等收到信号 就一起照射『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.96,1:24:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团队合作很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.26,1:24:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.16,1:24:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 这样下去的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.37,1:24:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们三百年的历史就到此为止了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.52,1:24:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.67,1:24:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.89,1:24:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.56,1:24:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.38,1:24:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.66,1:24:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.16,1:25:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 轨道修正了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.80,1:25:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.18,1:25:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上进行修复工作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.86,1:25:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.73,1:25:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.24,1:25:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.03,1:25:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.43,1:25:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.02,1:25:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.06,1:25:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯旋回归
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.94,1:25:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.81,1:25:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置修好了 就送你们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 都说了将破烂儿都搬走嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.00,1:25:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是破烂儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.83,1:25:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是大家对地球的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.10,1:25:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 很快就要分开了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.87,1:25:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.91,1:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.14,1:26:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体连带太多东西 出不来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.87,1:26:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.62,1:26:14.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『硬硬灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.01,1:26:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你变得硬邦邦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.04,1:26:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是摩亚？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.74,1:26:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个机器人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.94,1:26:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 摩亚没有属于自己的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.55,1:26:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它进入了机器人里面
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.42,1:26:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.21,1:26:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分钟后就会回复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.91,1:26:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.06,1:26:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『飞行行李签-宇宙版』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.30,1:26:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写上寄送地址
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.44,1:26:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要寄出去？哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.08,1:26:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.96,1:26:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚到底是什么来的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.24,1:27:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是隐藏在大家内心的邪恶凝聚物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.48,1:27:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 我在此再次宣言
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.28,1:27:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会遵从尤古道之树的教导
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.61,1:27:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论什么情况 都不容许用武力去移居某星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.85,1:27:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了能找到可以和平移居的星球 我们会继续旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.00,1:27:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在宇宙的某处 一定有个可以成为我们故乡的星球 等着我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.75,1:27:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的旅程是走向未来的希望之旅
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.44,1:27:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一定 要保护好这美丽的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.39,1:28:02.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不重蹈拉古娜星的悲剧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.85,1:28:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.65,1:28:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.67,1:28:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.97,1:28:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.55,1:28:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 李安 多多保重
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.04,1:28:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定会找到一个美丽的星球的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.20,1:28:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.04,1:28:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.64,1:28:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.42,1:28:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.56,1:28:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.89,1:28:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 待会见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.41,1:28:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我玩的很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.56,1:28:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.95,1:28:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是又去了幻觉之星的话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.80,1:28:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.64,1:28:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是之前的测验卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.21,1:28:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.71,1:28:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0分
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.41,1:28:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 不是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.21,1:28:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.11,1:29:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 有什么好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.26,1:29:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.71,1:29:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 太好了 呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.81,1:29:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...呢
